          ],
          "text": "Unconventional on purpose: depth does not drive power — it moves the ceiling (Limit Max 10→34). Being touched opens the power gently and lets it fade over 2.5 s. Eight Function nodes 45° apart sweep intensity around all eight segments of both channels every 33 s. A is a slow, deep staircase (5–40 Hz), B a fast one (40–100 Hz)."
